# The Tsar's Trans-Atlantic Voyagers: Passenger Data Visualization

This notebook provides comprehensive visualizations of the passenger data from the Trans-Atlantic Voyagers database, documenting migration from the Russian Empire to the United States (1834-1897).

**Dataset Overview:**
- 527,394 passenger records  
- Time period: 1834-1897 (63 years)
- Geographic coverage: Belarus, Finland, Poland, Russian Federation, Ukraine